    "kody login",
    "kody context register --name my-machine --org acme",
    "kody daemon",
  ],
  "login": "If your Kody login predates execution context permissions, registering fails and tells you to run \`kody login\` again first. Other logins keep working as they are.",
  "trust": [
    "Code sent to this context runs on that machine, under the account that runs kody daemon.",
    "It starts as Only me. If you share it, the people you share it with run code on that machine, and you can see their code, inputs, logs, results and the responses of credentialed requests their runs make. Their credential values stay on Kody.",
    "What it exposes (files, local network, internet) is set on the machine; the CLI prints it.",
  ],
}
`;

exports[`share copy for every access combination, as operator and as manager > allowlist:manager 1`] = `
{
  "firstShareRuntimeNote": "Others' runs can call no Kody APIs until you allow some.",
  "lan": null,
  "noInviteLinksNote": "Add people by their Kody username. There are no invite links, so access cannot be forwarded.",
  "ownerWithoutManageNote": "Only @sam or people with Manage can add access.",
  "paragraphs": [
    "Anyone you share with can run code on this machine (operated by @sam) after they opt in. @sam will be able to see their code, inputs, logs, results and the responses of credentialed requests their runs make; their credential values stay on Kody.",
    "Their runs get: files: 1 path, read · local network: no · internet: allowlist of 4 hosts · Kody APIs: none.",
    "While their run is active, this machine can make Kody API calls as them (within that Kody API access) and can change their results.",
  ],
  "title": "Share buildbox",
}
`;

